"name":"Wolf's Gravestone","text":"High ATK boosts wolf strikes. Strong generalist; low-HP buff situational."},{"name":"Beacon of the Reed Sea","text":"CRIT Rate and conditional ATK. Keep ATK passive active."},{"name":"Skyward Pride","text":"ER and Burst vacuum blades. When Burst uptime needs help."},{"name":"Serpent Spine","text":"CRIT and stackable damage. Shield helps preserve stacks."},{"name":"Mailed Flower","text":"EM and ATK for Aggravate. Trigger reactions consistently. R5 preferred."},{"name":"Rainslasher","text":"EM; bonus vs Electro-affected foes. Aggravate or Quickbloom. Higher refinements help."},{"name":"Tidal Shadow","text":"ATK bonus after healing. Requires reliable healing. R5 boosts ATK bonus."},{"name":"Prototype Archaic","text":"Accessible ATK and extra hit. Budget generalist."}],"a":[{"names":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Hexerei ATK and CRIT gains.","stats":"ATK% · Electro · CRIT"},{"names":["Thundering Fury"],"text":"Aggravate and faster Skill taps.","stats":"EM/ATK% · Electro · CRIT"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"EM and ATK for Quicken teams.","stats":"EM/ATK% · Electro · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Hexerei Thunderpack","members":["Razor","Fischl","Nahida","Baizhu"],"text":"Unlock both Hexerei quests. Fischl enables Secret Rite; Nahida sustains Quicken, Baizhu heals, and Razor overflows Sigils during Burst.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Shielder"]},{"name":"Witchfire Overload","members":["Razor","Durin","Chevreuse","Fischl"],"text":"Unlocked Hexerei teammates activate Secret Rite. Chevreuse enables Electro-Pyro RES shred; Durin and Fischl support Razor damage.","roles":["On-field DPS","DPS","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Hexerei Quickbloom","members":["Razor","Fischl","Nahida","Xingqiu"],"text":"Fischl enables Secret Rite; Nahida and Xingqiu generate Dendro Cores. Razor triggers some Hyperblooms; no dedicated healer.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler"]},{"name":"High shelf main boss friends","members":["Razor","Nahida","Xingqiu","Bennett"],"text":"Requires Bennett C6. Razor drives mixed Burgeon and Hyperbloom via Pyro-infused attacks and Burst Electro. No second Hexerei member.","roles":["On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Hexerei Main: Finish Witch Homework on Razor and Fischl. Build ATK/Electro/CRIT; use Burst and Skill taps to overflow Sigils.\nQuickbloom: Use Fischl, Nahida and Xingqiu; mix Electro and Hyperbloom. More EM can help, but watch sustain.\nPhysical DPS: Pale Flame, ATK/Physical/CRIT, Cryo teammate for Superconduct. Traditional sustained Normal Attack play.\nThundering Furry: Requires Bennett C6, Nahida and Xingqiu. Level 90 and triple EM; this does not trigger Secret Rite.\nHexerei C6: Razor C6 improves Sigil generation and grants CRIT bonuses after Sigil consumption. Strong with Secret Rite.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Witch's Homework boosts Razor's Burst Electro damage. With another unlocked Hexerei ally, overflowing Skill sigils triggers extra Electro strikes and Energy. This main build favors Electro Aggravate; Physical and C6 Bennett reaction builds are alternatives.","pros":["Hexerei adds Electro strikes","Aggravate and AoE potential","Fischl boosts consistency","Strong free weapon options"],"cons":["Needs Witch Homework","Secret Rite needs 2 Hexerei","Burst ends on switching","Long on-field commitment"],"weapons":["Wolf's Gravestone","Beacon of the Reed Sea","Skyward Pride","Serpent Spine","Mailed Flower","Rainslasher","Tidal Shadow","Prototype Archaic"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ATK% / Elemental Mastery","Electro DMG Bonus","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["CR: 60% - 75%","CD: 120% - 170%","ER: Team dependent","ATK: 1700 - 2200","EM: 100 - 250"],"vars":[{"title":"Hexerei Quickbloom","role":"On-field Reaction DPS","weapons":["Wolf's Gravestone","Mailed Flower","Rainslasher"],"arts":[{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% or EM sands; Electro goblet; prioritize CRIT, ER, then useful EM.","teams":"Razor and Fischl with completed Hexerei unlocks; Dendro and Hydro teammates.","when":"Use Burst and Skill taps to overflow Sigils; Hydro enables some Hyperblooms alongside Electro damage. Confirm energy and sustain.","cond":"","notes":"No dedicated healer in Razor/Fischl/Nahida/Xingqiu. Reactions vary with elemental auras.","pre":false},{"title":"Thundering Furry (C6 Bennett)","role":"On-field Reaction DPS","weapons":["Mailed Flower","Rainslasher","Bloodtainted Greatsword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Level 90; EM/EM/EM; ER until Burst is reliable.","teams":"C6 Bennett, Dendro and Hydro (e.g. Nahida/Xingqiu).","when":"Bennett Pyro infusion plus Razor Burst Electro causes Burgeon, Hyperbloom and Overloaded. Stay in Bennett field.","cond":"Bennett C6 required","notes":"No Hexerei Secret Rite with this four-character composition.","pre":false},{"title":"Physical Superconduct DPS","role":"On-field Physical DPS","weapons":["Wolf's Gravestone","Song of Broken Pines","Serpent Spine","Prototype Archaic"],"arts":[{"sets":["Pale Flame"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% sands; Physical DMG goblet; CRIT circlet; adjust ER to team.","teams":"Cryo applier for Superconduct; Electro battery and sustain preferred.","when":"For traditional Razor gameplay. Keep Superconduct active and stay on-field during his Burst.","cond":"Better for players investing in Physical damage","notes":"Witch Homework still boosts Wolf Within, but this build prioritizes Physical hits.","pre":false},{"title":"Hexerei C6 Sigil Carry","role":"On-field Electro DPS","weapons":["Wolf's Gravestone","Beacon of the Reed Sea","Serpent Spine"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK%/Electro/CRIT; C6 supplies conditional CRIT after Sigil consumption.","teams":"Razor C6, Witch Homework completed, plus another unlocked Hexerei ally.","when":"Use C6-enhanced Sigil generation and Skill taps during Burst to trigger overflow strikes and maintain Energy.","cond":"Razor C6 and two unlocked Hexerei members","notes":"Extra CRIT Rate and CRIT DMG follow Sigil consumption; do not assume they are permanently active.","pre":false}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Lightning Prism","Teachings of Resistance","Guide to Resistance","Philosophies of Resistance","Damaged Mask","Stained Mask","Ominous Mask","Wolfhook","Dvalin's Claw","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Lvl 9 - 10"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Lvl 8 - 9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Lvl 9 - 10"}],"teams":[{"name":"Hexerei Thunderpack","members":["Razor","Fischl","Nahida","Baizhu"]},{"name":"Witchfire Overload","members":["Razor","Durin","Chevreuse","Fischl"]},{"name":"Hexerei Quickbloom","members":["Razor","Fischl","Nahida","Xingqiu"]},{"name":"High shelf main boss friends","members":["Razor","Nahida","Xingqiu","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Razor","el":"Electro"}